    <string name="help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="help_body">SP Studio Pro is a native app for designing physical-therapy cards.\n\n• Choose a mode (Professional / Comparison / Q&amp;A) from the top bar.\n• Edit the text directly inside the card.\n• Use the "Properties" panel to change font size, line height, and font family.\n• Use the "Tools" panel to change colors or colorize individual words.\n• Tap "Save PNG" to export the card as an image and share it.</string>

